- # `↯/s.73.9` — `Timestamp.Error`
+ # `↯/s.73.9` — `Timestamp.Error`

- Raised when Aviation cannot parse a timestamp string.
+ Levée lorsque Aviation ne peut pas analyser une chaîne d'horodatage.

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- Aviation's timestamp parser expects an ISO-8601-style timestamp.
- The constructor records the offending `value` and a `reason: Reason`
- indicating which step of the parse failed; the rendered message is
- `the time $value could not be parsed because $reason`.
+ L'analyseur d'horodatages d'Aviation attend un horodatage de style ISO-8601. Le constructeur
+ enregistre la `value` fautive et une `reason: Reason` indiquant l'étape de l'analyse qui a échoué ;
+ le message affiché est `the time $value could not be parsed because $reason`.

- ## Variants
+ ## Variantes

- ### `↯/s.73.9.1` — `BadFormat`
+ ### `↯/s.73.9.1` — `BadFormat`

- The input did not match the expected ISO-8601 timestamp pattern at
- all.
+ L'entrée ne correspondait pas du tout au motif d'horodatage ISO-8601 attendu.

- **Example.** `[↯/s.73.9.1] the time not-a-timestamp could not be parsed because the input did not match the expected timestamp format`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.73.9.1] the time not-a-timestamp could not be parsed because the input did not match the expected timestamp format`

- **Resolution.** Provide the timestamp in ISO-8601 form
- (`YYYY-MM-DD[T ]HH:MM:SS`); pre-process non-standard inputs.
+ **Résolution.** Fournissez l'horodatage sous forme ISO-8601 (`YYYY-MM-DD[T ]HH:MM:SS`) ;
+ prétraitez les entrées non standard.

- ### `↯/s.73.9.2` — `BadNumber`
+ ### `↯/s.73.9.2` — `BadNumber`

- The input matched the timestamp pattern but one of its numeric
- components could not be parsed as an integer (a `Number.Error` was
- raised internally).
+ L'entrée correspondait au motif d'horodatage, mais l'une de ses composantes numériques n'a pas pu
+ être analysée comme un entier (une `Number.Error` a été levée en interne).

- **Example.** `[↯/s.73.9.2] the time 2024-XX-15T14:30:59 could not be parsed because a numeric component could not be parsed as an integer`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.73.9.2] the time 2024-XX-15T14:30:59 could not be parsed because a numeric component could not be parsed as an integer`

- **Resolution.** Confirm each component (year, month, day, hour,
- minute, second) is a plain decimal integer.
+ **Résolution.** Vérifiez que chaque composante (année, mois, jour, heure, minute, seconde) est un
+ simple entier décimal.

- ### `↯/s.73.9.3` — `BadTime`
+ ### `↯/s.73.9.3` — `BadTime`

- A date or time component was outside its valid range — e.g. month
- 13, day 32, or hour 25 (a `Moment.Error` was raised internally).
+ Une composante de date ou d'heure était hors de son intervalle valide — par exemple le mois 13,
+ le jour 32 ou l'heure 25 (une `Moment.Error` a été levée en interne).

- **Example.** `[↯/s.73.9.3] the time 2024-13-15T14:30:59 could not be parsed because a date or time component was outside the valid range`
+ **Exemple.** `[↯/s.73.9.3] the time 2024-13-15T14:30:59 could not be parsed because a date or time component was outside the valid range`

- **Resolution.** Validate the component values before formatting,
- or compute them from a calendar that constrains them to legal
- ranges.
+ **Résolution.** Validez les valeurs des composantes avant le formatage, ou calculez-les à partir
+ d'un calendrier qui les contraint aux intervalles autorisés.

